// Automation rules (v0.9).
// Entries of the `error_codes!` macro in `../error.rs` (see there). Never rename or reuse a code.
/// A rule is invalid (`details.field`: `name`, `trigger`, `flags`, `every_mins`, `actions`,
/// `ids`; for actions also `details.index` and `details.reason`: `not_allowed`, `params`).
ValidationAutomationRule => Validation, "errors.validation.automation_rule";
/// Automation rule not found (`details.id`).
NotFoundAutomationRule => NotFound, "errors.not_found.automation_rule";
